    "column_header": "Remarks.",
    "raw_text": "Besides the amount mentioned in column 2, Chunveerupa bin Chunbusupa Neelee, a Native trader, spent 1,500 Rupees in feeding the poor of Hooblee for four months. Gungapa bin Amhuna Bendigherry spent 540 Rs. in feeding the poor for three months. Four others, by name Siduppa Warkar, Sidhugapa Menchinkai, Chenupa Uddurgoonchi, and Udrepa Oogurgole, spent jointly Rs. 860 in feeding the poor for five months. Govindupa bin Soobupa Koomptee expended 150 Rs. in feeding the poor for two months.",
